{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23911","headline":"题崔常侍济上别墅 · 白居易","name":"题崔常侍济上别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求荣争宠任纷纷，脱弃金貂祗有君。\n散员疏去未爲贵，小邑陶休何足云。\n山色好当晴後见，泉声宜向醉中闻。\n主人忆尔尔知否，抛却青云归白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}